          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold">DemoLens</h2>
          <p class="text-on-surface/80 mt-2 max-w-prose">DemoLens is a Chrome extension that simulates real data and controls what’s displayed in the browser, enabling curated dashboards and scenarios for demos.</p>
          <div class="mt-6 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-divider bg-surface p-6">
              <h3 class="font-semibold">Overview</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-on-surface/80 mt-2">Chrome extension designed to simulate real data in parts of Zendesk like Explore and Talk. Create dashboards and scenarios that adapt to different demo narratives.</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-on-surface/80 mt-2"><strong>Built by:</strong> Daniel Montes — Senior Demo Engineer</p>

            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-divider bg-surface p-6">
              <h3 class="font-semibold">How it works</h3>
              <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 text-sm text-on-surface/80">
                <li>Create dashboards</li>
                <li>Enable / Disable scenarios (one at a time)</li>
                <li>Instance cloning support to reuse curated data across demos</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 py-4">
            <a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/zendesk-demolens-z3n-demo/lfahnofhgcmbbmikobjdgloecloeoehd" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="py-3 inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full sm:w-auto gap-3 px-4 bg-primary text-white rounded-lg text-xl font-semibold hover:opacity-95 transition"> 
